<section class="problem-section" id="problem">
  <div class="s-label reveal">The Core Problem</div>
  <h2 class="s-title reveal stagger-1">Why Following the Pattern Perfectly<br><em>Is Exactly What Breaks the Fit</em></h2>
  <div class="problem-grid">
    <div class="problem-body reveal stagger-2">
      <p>Here is the part nobody tells you: the pattern is not wrong, and neither are you. The problem is that every crochet pattern is written for a body that does not exist. It is a mathematical average — a flat, proportional shape that assumes your shoulders, bust, waist, and hips all scale up together in neat, identical steps.</p>
      <p>Most real bodies do not work that way. Yours probably does not either.</p>
      <p>So when you pick a size and follow every instruction to the letter, you are not making a mistake. You are just applying a one-size road map to a landscape it was never drawn for. The armholes land in the wrong place. The bust pulls. The waist hangs like a tent. And you are left holding something you spent weeks making... that you cannot bring yourself to wear.</p>
      <p>That is not a skill problem. <strong style="color:var(--cream)">It is a process problem.</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal stagger-3">
      <div class="problem-pullquote">"I picked the size closest to my bust, but now everything else looks wrong."</div>
      <div style="margin-top:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(250,247,242,0.5);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:var(--terracotta);flex-shrink:0">—</span>"I do not want to mess up the whole pattern just because my waist is different."</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(250,247,242,0.5);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:var(--terracotta);flex-shrink:0">—</span>"Every time I try to size up, the sweater looks boxy."</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(250,247,242,0.5);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:var(--terracotta);flex-shrink:0">—</span>"I followed the pattern exactly, and it still does not fit right."</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(250,247,242,0.5);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:var(--terracotta);flex-shrink:0">—</span>"I just want to make it fit my body without starting over."</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
